# Evolution: Candidate Pool

Spec: CandidatePoolIndex
Purpose:
  Entry point for the evolution candidate pool. Lists subdirectories
  where AI-discovered knowledge awaits validation and promotion.

Owns: evolution/INDEX.sdd

Structure:
  .sdd/evolution/
    ├── INDEX.sdd           (this file)
    ├── discovery.sdd
    ├── import-plan.sdd
    ├── candidates/         — proposed concepts/skills/decisions
    ├── candidates/INDEX.sdd
    ├── challenges/         — decision challenges (DEC-88 status: challenged)
    ├── challenges/INDEX.sdd
    ├── proposals/          — architecture/skill proposals (A22)
    ├── proposals/INDEX.sdd
    └── approved/           — validated and approved items
    └── approved/INDEX.sdd

ReadOrder:
  1  @discovery.sdd
  2  @import-plan.sdd
  3  ./candidates/INDEX.sdd
  4  ./proposals/INDEX.sdd
  5  ./approved/INDEX.sdd

Navigation:
  Discovery: @discovery.sdd
  ImportPlan: @import-plan.sdd
  Candidates: @candidates/INDEX.sdd
  Challenges: @challenges/INDEX.sdd
  Proposals: @proposals/INDEX.sdd
  Approved: @approved/INDEX.sdd
  EvolutionPolicy: @../policies/evolution.sdd
  Concepts: @../concepts/INDEX.sdd
  Knowledge: @../knowledge/INDEX.sdd

State: +
